 "blocksHtml": "<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screen_Mockup_Ginsburg.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3031\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid grid--no-gutter flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nTrue/False\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-10/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\n<br/>\nCan we still believe in visuals? Can we distinguish between true and false in the digital era and the development of generative AI? These were the questions that the KIKK team posed to us when briefing in the theme for the 2024 edition of the festival; True/False.<br/>\n<br/>\nOur response to this both challenging and exciting brief was to create a visual direction that explored the idea of distorting reality and presenting these 2 versions in a slick animated identity.<br/>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Venue-Screen-05-Standard-Mockup.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3113\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/3D_PORTRAIT_SCREEN.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3043\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/3D_LANDSCAPE_SCREEN.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3049\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"js-grid-slider mb-5 mb-10@sm overflow-hidden user-select-none\" data-cursor=\"drag\" data-cursor-progress=\"0\" style=\"touch-action: pan-y\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"d-flex items-center\" style=\"user-select: none;\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2 w-1/4@sm mr-5 mr-8@sm flex-no-shrink pointer-events-none\">\n<div class=\"mb-2\" style=\"perspective: 1000px;\">\n<div class=\"js-grid-slider-text\">\n<h2 animate-from=\"preset: 'fadeUp'\" class=\"mb-1 t-500 t-lh-1.1 t-uppercase t-ls-tight t-base\">Process: Generative Visual Exploration</h2>\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">During the initial phases of the project we experimented with a number of techniques to create the distorted graphical representations, including generative code based tools built in WebGL, touch designer visuals and traditional 3d graphics.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none js-slider-items\">\n<div class=\"d-flex mb-4\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(12%, -12%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"30\" dom2webgl=\"image30763800\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/01.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(13%, -2%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image31344235\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/box.png\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(10%, 2%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-70\" dom2webgl=\"image30795079\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bandicam-2024-06-06-12-29-41-168.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(9%, -14%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image30891380\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sketches-Ash-01-Sketch.Js.2024.05.14-11.21.02.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(9%, -1%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-50\" dom2webgl=\"image30781908\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bandicam-2024-04-11-15-56-33-865.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-1%, 4%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-100\" dom2webgl=\"image30833710\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bandicam-2025-01-14-15-22-50-053.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-3%, -1%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"89\" dom2webgl=\"image30825125\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bandicam-2025-01-14-15-22-14-202.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(6%, -4%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"130\" dom2webgl=\"image3137668\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Frame-44.jpg\"/></div></div><div class=\"d-flex\"><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-5%, 10%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-100\" dom2webgl=\"image30776061\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bandicam-2024-04-11-15-56-09-947.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-11%, 7%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"50\" dom2webgl=\"image30802867\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Bandicam-2025-01-14-15-21-31-633.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(9%, -3%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-150\" dom2webgl=\"image313568\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Frame-42.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-4%, -5%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"200\" dom2webgl=\"image30874327\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Conedance1.mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-15%, 1%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-201\" dom2webgl=\"image31367186\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Frame-43.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(5%, 14%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"303\" dom2webgl=\"image31387684\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Frame-45.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(14%, 0%)\"><video alt=\"\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-20\" dom2webgl=\"image30863614\" draggable=\"false\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Chrome-Yehq71wijk.mp4\"></video></div></div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA Unique Touch\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nAs with all our projects, we strive to explore new technologies and integrate them into our workflows. During our initial exploration of techniques for creating the distorted visuals, we found that the results produced in TouchDesigner were really promising. Embracing this potential, we developed a process to generate unique visuals using simple gradients, 3D assets or even the webcam feed as inputs, generating a dynamic and interactive point field which would be used to drive the distortion of an evolving gradient, creative a for a unique and pattern with each generation.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/movieout-1.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3099\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/lanyards-1.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3140\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screen-06.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3124\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Schedule-Screen.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3115\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Social.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3022\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image30936aaa8ecf7807a\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/phone-1-1920x1280.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image31226aaa8ecf7852b\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/website-1920x1320.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"testimonial w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 my-10@md\">\n<h2 class=\"t-1.3 t-2@sm t-uppercase mb-0 t-500\">From the client</h2>\n<div class=\"testimonial__text-box mt-1 pt-1 mb-1.5\">\n<p class=\"w-1/1 t-2 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-500 mb-0\">\n“The KIKK Festival 2024 visual identity perfectly reflects this year’s thematic focus while embracing the festival’s unique, bold, and crazy spirit. It brilliantly captures the energy and creativity that make KIKK so special, turning our vision into a dynamic visual experience that truly resonates with our community.”\n</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"t-uppercase t-base t-1.3@sm t-500\">\nMarie du Chastel, KIKK Festival\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image30946aaa8ecf80d7c\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/apparal.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screen_Mockup_Sesko-1.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3101\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image30456aaa8ecf8177c\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/timetable-1920x1329.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/social-2.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3025\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/phone.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3109\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image30516aaa8ecf8247d\" src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/poster-1920x1216.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"https://unseen.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Screen_Mockup_Sag.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image3119\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>",
